    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2013540/extras/b72fbb3d19f13b9cac6dd3c24c425c52.webp?t=1747133330\" /></div><br>Bump your friends out of the arena in this belly-centric party game. Play with 2-8 local players on a single device! Cross-platform online multiplayer is also supported for 2-8 players.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2013540/extras/a65d468ddbae99e32a75d56449c442f2.poster.avif?t=1747133330\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2013540/extras/a65d468ddbae99e32a75d56449c442f2.webm?t=1747133330\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2013540/extras/a65d468ddbae99e32a75d56449c442f2.mp4?t=1747133330\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2013540/extras/59c2d8b98a21cedf1575aa0b201c78cb.webp?t=1747133330\" /></div><br>Eat burgers to increase the size of your belly and the power of your bumpers. Be careful as you eat a variety of foods because some have horrible side effects!<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2013540/extras/ff89d1ff3b0cc1578190bd60aeb8db8a.poster.avif?t=1747133330\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2013540/extras/ff89d1ff3b0cc1578190bd60aeb8db8a.webm?t=1747133330\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2013540/extras/ff89d1ff3b0cc1578190bd60aeb8db8a.mp4?t=1747133330\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2013540/extras/90cac59da0d4a0e8fa36c8f8bb908b91.webp?t=1747133330\" /></div><br>Force-feed opponents until their bellies burst by slapping them in the face with food!<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2013540/extras/119b1c3d6669f140eb737fda6ebfb825.poster.avif?t=1747133330\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2013540/extras/119b1c3d6669f140eb737fda6ebfb825.webm?t=1747133330\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2013540/extras/119b1c3d6669f140eb737fda6ebfb825.mp4?t=1747133330\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2013540/extras/1ede759dbdba2610a849ceb33cddd7b3.webp?t=1747133330\" /></div><br>Bump it out on over 10 food-themed stages. Each stage has unique interactive food elements such as stretchy licorice!<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2013540/extras/974af559c233943ffc09a130824ab920.poster.avif?t=1747133330\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2013540/extras/974af559c233943ffc09a130824ab920.webm?t=1747133330\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2013540/extras/974af559c233943ffc09a130824ab920.mp4?t=1747133330\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2013540/extras/1ea056fd424b0e5e0bce894e6837e20a.webp?t=1747133330\" /></div><br>Play with only the tastiest foods. Set your own rules, modify bump powers, choose stages, and more with in our customizable games. <br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2013540/extras/61025041ae77b65efac5eeac7dac1151.poster.avif?t=1747133330\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2013540/extras/61025041ae77b65efac5eeac7dac1151.webm?t=1747133330\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2013540/extras/61025041ae77b65efac5eeac7dac1151.mp4?t=1747133330\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2013540/extras/8bff8384e85cce0c12fdd2737398f03c.webp?t=1747133330\" /></div><br>Meet the Belly Bumpers! Choose your favorite color Bumper to play as. Each has their own unique design and personality.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2013540/extras/825008013cc551b267b6f0a3d8e8196d.avif?t=1747133330\" /></div>",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2013540/extras/b72fbb3d19f13b9cac6dd3c24c425c52.webp?t=1747133330\" /></div><br>Bump your friends out of the arena in this belly-centric party game. Play with 2-8 local players on a single device! Cross-platform online multiplayer is also supported for 2-8 players.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2013540/extras/a65d468ddbae99e32a75d56449c442f2.poster.avif?t=1747133330\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2013540/extras/a65d468ddbae99e32a75d56449c442f2.webm?t=1747133330\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2013540/extras/a65d468ddbae99e32a75d56449c442f2.mp4?t=1747133330\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2013540/extras/59c2d8b98a21cedf1575aa0b201c78cb.webp?t=1747133330\" /></div><br>Eat burgers to increase the size of your belly and the power of your bumpers. Be careful as you eat a variety of foods because some have horrible side effects!<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2013540/extras/ff89d1ff3b0cc1578190bd60aeb8db8a.poster.avif?t=1747133330\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2013540/extras/ff89d1ff3b0cc1578190bd60aeb8db8a.webm?t=1747133330\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2013540/extras/ff89d1ff3b0cc1578190bd60aeb8db8a.mp4?t=1747133330\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><div class=\"bb